<title>USA: BankAmerica to buy Honolulu Mortgage.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica to buy Honolulu Mortgage.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Corp said its BankAmerica Mortgage will purchase substantially all assets and operations of Honolulu Mortgage Co.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.  The agreement is subject to regulatory approval and is expected to close during the first quarter of this year.</p>
<p>The acquired business will become part of BankAmerica Mortgage -- one of the nation's largest mortgage lenders.</p>
